{
 "lane": "tools",
 "slug": "freelance-steady-paycheck-calculator",
 "title": "Freelance Steady Paycheck and Runway Calculator",
 "description": "Turn lumpy freelance income into a steady monthly paycheck. Enter the last 12 months of income and your essential costs to see a safe amount to pay yourself, how many months your buffer covers, and a replay of your year showing if that paycheck would have held up.",
 "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Freelance Steady Paycheck and Runway Calculator</title>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#fbfaf7;--card:#ffffff;--fg:#22212b;--dim:#6b6878;--line:#e4e1d8;--accent:#7a4fb3;--soft:#f3eefa;--ok:#2f8a4c;--warn:#a6551c;--bad:#b3261e;--bar:#c9b6e6}\n@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--bg:#17161f;--card:#201f2b;--fg:#ebe8df;--dim:#a19db0;--line:#33313f;--accent:#b192e6;--soft:#262035;--ok:#4fbf74;--warn:#e39a62;--bad:#f28b82;--bar:#5b4785}}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px 48px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:28px;line-height:1.2}\nh2{font-size:18px;margin:28px 0 10px}\np.lead{margin:0 0 20px;color:var(--dim)}\n.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:14px}\n.months{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(110px,1fr));gap:10px}\nlabel{display:block;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\nlabel span{display:block;font-weight:400;color:var(--dim);font-size:13px}\n.months label{font-weight:500;font-size:13px}\ninput,select{width:100%;margin-top:6px;padding:10px;font:inherit;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;background:var(--card);color:var(--fg)}\ninput:focus,select:focus{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:1px}\nfieldset{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px 14px;margin:0 0 14px;background:var(--card)}\nlegend{font-weight:600;padding:0 6px}\nbutton{font:inherit;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);color:var(--fg);cursor:pointer}\nbutton.primary{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:#fff}\nbutton:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}\n.bar{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}\n.out{margin-top:20px;padding:18px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--soft);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(160px,1fr));gap:12px}\n.out div b{display:block;font-size:24px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.out div small{color:var(--dim)}\n.verdict{margin-top:16px;padding:14px 16px;border-left:4px solid var(--ok);background:var(--card);border-radius:0 8px 8px 0}\n.verdict.mid{border-color:var(--warn)}.verdict.low{border-color:var(--bad)}\n.chart{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:4px;height:160px;padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:var(--card);position:relative}\n.chart .col{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;height:100%;position:relative}\n.chart .col i{display:block;background:var(--bar);border-radius:3px 3px 0 0;min-height:1px}\n.chart .col i.neg{background:var(--bad)}\n.chart .line{position:absolute;left:8px;right:8px;border-top:2px dashed var(--accent)}\n.legend{font-size:13px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:6px}\ntable{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\nth,td{text-align:right;padding:8px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\nth:first-child,td:first-child{text-align:left}\nth{color:var(--dim);font-weight:600}\ntd.neg{color:var(--bad);font-weight:600}\n.wrap{overflow-x:auto}\n.note{font-size:13px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:24px}\n.err{color:var(--bad);font-size:14px;margin-top:8px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body><main>\n<h1>Freelance Steady Paycheck and Runway Calculator</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">Freelance income arrives in lumps. Enter what came in over the last twelve months and what you need to live on. Get a steady monthly amount you can pay yourself, how many months your buffer covers, and a replay of your year showing whether that paycheck would have held up. Nothing leaves your browser.</p>\n\n<fieldset><legend>What came in, month by month</legend>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--dim)\">Money received into your business in each of the last 12 months, after business expenses. Use 0 for a month with nothing. Oldest first.</p>\n<div class=\"months\" id=\"months\"></div>\n</fieldset>\n\n<fieldset><legend>Your money and your needs</legend>\n<div class=\"grid\">\n<label>Currency symbol<input id=\"cur\" value=\"$\" maxlength=\"4\"></label>\n<label>Set aside for tax (%)<span>Your own estimate; this tool does not work it out</span><input id=\"tax\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"80\" step=\"1\" value=\"25\"></label>\n<label>Buffer you hold today<span>Cash kept for lean months, after tax money</span><input id=\"buf\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"4000\"></label>\n<label>Essential costs per month<span>Rent, food, bills, debt minimums</span><input id=\"ess\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"2600\"></label>\n<label>Buffer target (months)<span>Of essential costs</span><input id=\"target\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"3\"></label>\n<label>Paycheck method\n<select id=\"method\">\n<option value=\"safe\">Cautious: lower of median and average, less 10%</option>\n<option value=\"avg\">Average: full 12-month average</option>\n<option value=\"custom\">My own amount</option>\n</select></label>\n<label id=\"customL\">My paycheck per month<input id=\"custom\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"3000\"></label>\n</div></fieldset>\n\n<div class=\"bar\"><button class=\"primary\" id=\"go\" type=\"button\">Calculate</button><button id=\"ex\" type=\"button\">Load example year</button><button id=\"clear\" type=\"button\">Clear months</button></div>\n<div id=\"err\" class=\"err\" role=\"alert\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"out\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n<div><small>Average take-home per month</small><b id=\"oAvg\">-</b></div>\n<div><small>Steady paycheck</small><b id=\"oPay\">-</b></div>\n<div><small>Runway today</small><b id=\"oRun\">-</b></div>\n<div><small>Buffer target</small><b id=\"oTgt\">-</b></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"verdict\" id=\"verdict\"></div>\n\n<h2>Your year, replayed with a steady paycheck</h2>\n<div class=\"chart\" id=\"chart\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<p class=\"legend\">Bars: take-home income each month (after tax set-aside). Dashed line: the steady paycheck. Red bars: months where the buffer would have run out.</p>\n<div class=\"wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Month</th><th>Came in</th><th>Tax set-aside</th><th>Take-home</th><th>Paycheck</th><th>Buffer after</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"rows\"></tbody></table></div>\n\n<h2>How to use the number</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Open a separate account (or pot) for the business, one for tax, and pay everything that comes in there first.</li>\n<li>On the same day each month, move the steady paycheck to your personal account. Do not pay yourself more in a good month.</li>\n<li>Whatever is left above the paycheck builds the buffer. Once the buffer reaches your target, you can raise the paycheck a little, or put the extra toward other goals.</li>\n<li>If the buffer ever drops below one month of essential costs, cut the paycheck to essentials only until it recovers, and put your energy into finding work.</li>\n<li>Run this again every quarter with fresh numbers.</li>\n</ol>\n<p class=\"note\">This is a planning aid that does simple arithmetic on the numbers you enter. It is general information, not financial or tax advice. The right tax set-aside depends on where you live and how your business is set up, so confirm it with an accountant or your tax authority's guidance.</p>\n</main>\n<script>\n(function(){\nvar $=function(i){return document.getElementById(i)};\nvar EX=[4200,5400,2800,600,6200,4100,3900,4800,7500,1900,4600,4300];\nvar names=[];\n(function build(){\n  var t=new Date(),h='';\n  for(var k=12;k>=1;k--){var d=new Date(t.getFullYear(),t.getMonth()-k,1);names.push(d.toLocaleDateString(undefined,{month:'short',year:'2-digit'}))}\n  for(var i=0;i<12;i++)h+='<label>'+names[i]+'<input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1\" id=\"m'+i+'\"></label>';\n  $('months').innerHTML=h;\n})();\nfunction v(id){var x=parseFloat($(id).value);return isFinite(x)&&x>0?x:0}\nfunction money(x){var c=$('cur').value||'';var s=Math.round(Math.abs(x)).toLocaleString();return (x<0?'-':'')+c+s}\nfunction median(a){var s=a.slice().sort(function(p,q){return p-q});var m=s.length>>1;return s.length%2?s[m]:(s[m-1]+s[m])/2}\nfunction toggle(){$('customL').style.display=$('method').value==='custom'?'':'none'}\nfunction calc(){\n  $('err').textContent='';\n  var inc=[],filled=0;\n  for(var i=0;i<12;i++){var raw=$('m'+i).value;if(raw!=='')filled++;inc.push(v('m'+i))}\n  if(filled<3){$('err').textContent='Enter at least three months of income (use 0 for empty months).';return}\n  var tax=Math.min(80,v('tax'))/100,ess=v('ess'),buf0=v('buf'),tgtM=v('target');\n  var take=inc.map(function(x){return x*(1-tax)});\n  var avg=take.reduce(function(a,b){return a+b},0)/12;\n  var med=median(take);\n  var pay;\n  var m=$('method').value;\n  if(m==='avg')pay=avg;else if(m==='custom')pay=v('custom');else pay=Math.min(avg,med)*0.9;\n  pay=Math.floor(pay/10)*10;\n  var tgt=ess*tgtM;\n  $('oAvg').textContent=money(avg);\n  $('oPay').textContent=money(pay);\n  $('oRun').textContent=ess>0?(buf0/ess).toFixed(1)+' mo':'-';\n  $('oTgt').textContent=money(tgt);\n  var buf=buf0,low=buf0,lowAt=-1,broke=[],rows='';\n  var max=Math.max.apply(null,take.concat([pay,1]));\n  var bars='';\n  for(i=0;i<12;i++){\n    buf+=take[i]-pay;\n    if(buf<low){low=buf;lowAt=i}\n    var neg=buf<0;if(neg)broke.push(names[i]);\n    rows+='<tr><td>'+names[i]+'</td><td>'+money(inc[i])+'</td><td>'+money(inc[i]*tax)+'</td><td>'+money(take[i])+'</td><td>'+money(pay)+'</td><td'+(neg?' class=\"neg\"':'')+'>'+money(buf)+'</td></tr>';\n    bars+='<div class=\"col\" title=\"'+names[i]+'\"><i'+(neg?' class=\"neg\"':'')+' style=\"height:'+(take[i]/max*100).toFixed(1)+'%\"></i></div>';\n  }\n  bars+='<div class=\"line\" style=\"bottom:calc(8px + '+(pay/max*100*0.9).toFixed(1)+'%)\"></div>';\n  $('chart').innerHTML=bars;\n  var line=$('chart').querySelector('.line');\n  line.style.bottom='calc(8px + (100% - 16px) * '+(pay/max).toFixed(4)+')';\n  $('rows').innerHTML=rows;\n  var vd=$('verdict');vd.className='verdict';\n  var msg='';\n  var yearSurplus=(avg-pay)*12;\n  if(pay<ess&&avg>=ess&&m!=='custom'){vd.classList.add('mid');msg='<b>The cautious paycheck ('+money(pay)+') is below your essential costs ('+money(ess)+'), but your average take-home ('+money(avg)+') covers them.</b> Your income is uneven rather than too low. Try the paycheck method \"My own amount\" set to your essential costs and check that the replay below stays above zero; if it does not, the buffer is what needs to grow first.'}\n  else if(pay<ess&&avg<ess){vd.classList.add('low');msg='<b>The steady paycheck ('+money(pay)+') is below your essential costs ('+money(ess)+').</b> Your past year did not bring in enough on average to cover essentials every month at this tax set-aside. On average you are about '+money(ess-avg)+' a month short: that is the amount of extra work, higher rates or lower costs to aim for.'}\n  else if(broke.length){vd.classList.add('mid');msg='<b>This paycheck would have emptied your buffer in '+broke.join(', ')+'.</b> Either start with a bigger buffer, or lower the paycheck until the replay stays above zero. The lowest point was '+money(low)+'.'}\n  else{msg='<b>This paycheck held up all year.</b> Your buffer never went below '+money(low)+(lowAt>=0?' (in '+names[lowAt]+')':'')+'.'}\n  if(tgt>0&&pay>=ess){\n    if(buf0>=tgt)msg+=' You already hold your '+tgtM+'-month target.';\n    else if(avg>pay){var need=tgt-buf0;var mo=Math.ceil(need/(avg-pay));msg+=' At this paycheck you would reach your '+tgtM+'-month buffer target in about '+mo+' month'+(mo===1?'':'s')+' on an average year.'}\n    else msg+=' At this paycheck the buffer will not grow on an average year; lower it a little to build toward your target.';\n  }\n  vd.innerHTML=msg;\n}\n$('go').addEventListener('click',calc);\n$('method').addEventListener('change',function(){toggle();calc()});\n['cur','tax','buf','ess','target','custom'].forEach(function(i){$(i).addEventListener('change',calc)});\n$('months').addEventListener('change',calc);\n$('ex').addEventListener('click',function(){for(var i=0;i<12;i++)$('m'+i).value=EX[i];calc()});\n$('clear').addEventListener('click',function(){for(var i=0;i<12;i++)$('m'+i).value='';$('rows').innerHTML='';$('chart').innerHTML='';$('verdict').textContent=''});\nfor(var i=0;i<12;i++)$('m'+i).value=EX[i];\ntoggle();calc();\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>\n"
}